WEBVTT

00:40:26.496 --> 00:40:30.329
This episode was produced by Jessica
Glaser and supported by Viking Penguin.

00:40:31.079 --> 00:40:35.371
Think again. The power of knowing what you
don't know is available in whatever

00:40:35.371 --> 00:40:41.704
format you like print, electronic stone,
tablet or audio narrated by me.